Hi folks - I’ve just noticed this also. It has something to do with a new update of optimx.

I’m not sure what the optimx people did that messed this up, but if you change :

$use_optimix = TRUE

To

$use_optimix = ”GenSA”

...everything in the example script works again.  You will also need to do:

library(GenSA)

I’ve edited the example script on phylowiki. I’ve also edited it to use the new versions of rexpokit and cladoRcpp from CRAN, and the new development BioGeoBEARS on GitHub. Install the first two, then install the latter with devtools’s install_guthub function. (Bigger post later).

Cheers, Nick

